// E1103: the second table has the same `id` as the first. The error is at the `id` value of the table written later,
// and none is at the first (the position is a detail the spec leaves open; this is the form of the design memo of
// W4-02) (§15.3 `id` row, §14.3, §18.1; S-580).

@export
pub flow voice(x: F32 at sample) -> F32 at sample { x }
